  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1203.34 Metal furniture coating",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1203.34 \"Metal furniture coating\" means the surface coating of:\n\n(a) Any furniture made of metal; or\n\n(b) Any metal part that will be assembled with other metal, wood, fabric, plastic, or glass parts to form a furniture piece.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-A 1200) #9933, eff 6-1-11; ss by #12899, eff 10-17-19",
